<v Abraham>Thank you, Antonio, for bringing the 24 pizzas. We hope everything's going well at the temple out in Bay Ridge.
<v Abraham>谢谢你，安东尼奥（Antonio），带了24个披萨。我们希望湾岭（Bay Ridge）的会堂一切顺利。

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:52.030
<v Aidy Bryant>It truly is. Please continue. I'll stay quiet, I promise, for the rest of the meeting.
<v Aidy Bryant>确实很好。请继续。我保持安静，我保证，会议剩下的时间里。

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:58.730
<v Jacob>Antonio, you guys have been getting sweat everywhere.
<v Jacob>安东尼奥，你们带得满地都是汗。

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:27.530
<v Aidy Bryant>Eh, my favorite thing about being Jewish is, of course, the sweet lasagna! And I want everyone to know that I'm trying my absolute hardest. I feel we must move on.
<v Aidy Bryant>嘿，我最喜欢犹太身份的就是，当然，甜蜜的千层面！我希望每个人都知道我已经在极尽全力了。我觉得我们必须继续。

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.510
<v Man>Scene.
<v Man>场景结束。

