<v Man>[AUDIENCE CHEERING]
<v Man>[观众欢呼]

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:43.740
<v Aidy Bryant>I'm sorry. I'm sorry to all the cultures everywhere around the world.
<v Aidy Bryant>我很抱歉。我向世界各地所有的文化道歉。

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:47.380
<v Man>Fellas, fellas, fellas, get in here. Fellas, I'm working on--
<v Man>伙计们，伙计们，过来。伙计们，我正在努力——

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.030
<v Woman 1>Yeah, yeah, yeah, what's up? Yeah.
<v Woman 1>对，对，对，怎么了？

00:17:50.030 --> 00:18:00.320
<v Man>I wanted to get the group back together for a Christmas song. And I was just thinking this one would be just "Five Golden Rings."
<v Man>我想把大家重新组织起来唱一首圣诞歌。我刚才在想，这首歌就只唱“5个金戒指”。

