<v Man>Jettison the other verses.
<v Man>抛弃其他段落。

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:04.980
<v Woman 1>Mm-hm.
<v Woman 1>嗯哼。

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:13.710
<v Man>We hit five golden rings hard, right? We circle back. You could do some scatting.
<v Man>我们要有力地唱好5个金戒指，对吧？我们循环回来。你可以加点即兴吟唱（Scatting）。

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:26.090
<v Woman 1>Oh, my god. Well, I'm in! If you're going to finally let me do it, then doopity dop dop, yeah!
<v Woman 1>噢，天哪。好吧，我加入！如果你终于要让我做了，那就嘟比嘟吧，耶！

