<v Man>I just think we all need to accept the truth, which is that nobody likes the other verses.
<v Man>我只是认为我们都需要接受真相，那就是没人喜欢其他段落。

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:37.300
<v Woman 2>I don't no, Jord. I feel like a lot of people are going to miss, like, calling birds.
<v Woman 2>我不觉得，乔德（Jord）。我觉得很多人会怀念像鸣叫的鸟之类的段落。

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:45.090
<v Woman 1>Yeah, or at least the nine ladies dancing. [SCATTING]
<v Woman 1>对，或者至少是那9个跳舞的女士。[即兴吟唱]

