<v Comedian>[HONKING  LIKE A GOOSE]
<v Comedian>[发出鹅叫声]

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:10.260
<v Woman>Dad, I've seen geese before. They're, like, really cute, and--
<v Woman>爸爸，我以前见过鹅。它们看起来，很可爱，而且——

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:15.800
<v Man>OK. You know I'm a big believer in letting you learn your lessons.
<v Man>好的。你知道我是那种让你从实践中学习的忠实信徒。

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.750
<v Woman>You always say that before, like, something really bad happens.
<v Woman>你每次在发生什么坏事之前都这么说。

