<v Man>Just this idea of "Wait, there's a week where there's no school?"
<v Man>那种“等等，居然有一个星期不用上学？”的想法。

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:50.170
<v Woman 2>It's so different when you don't celebrate Christmas. Because for you, it's two weeks where you don't see your friends, because they are all going somewhere cool and having fun.
<v Woman 2>当你不过圣诞节时感觉完全不同。因为对你来说，那是两个星期看不到朋友，因为他们都去很酷的地方玩了。

