<v Ira Glass>我们的一位制片人，斯蒂芬妮·富（Stephanie Foo），最近发现了一个在我们国家依然相当新鲜的圣诞传统，真的，给她带来了快乐，真的，让世界对她来说看起来变得更大、更美好了。这是她的报道。

00:43:04.900 --> 00:43:31.730
<v Stephanie Foo>I don't remember how I stumbled on my very first turkey explosion video. But I do remember everything else about it. The video is called "Why you should never deep fry a frozen turkey." Two firefighters are standing at the ready in front of a fire truck on a lawn somewhere. In front of them stands a large pot full of hot oil and a propane burner. Another firefighter in full gear comes out with a raw, pink turkey hanging from the end of a long stick.
<v Stephanie Foo>我不记得我是怎么偶然发现第一个炸火鸡爆炸视频的。但我确实记得关于它的其他一切。那个视频叫“为什么你永远不应该深炸冷冻火鸡”。两名消防员在某处的草坪上，在一辆消防车前待命。在他们前面是一个盛满热油和丙烷燃烧器的大锅。另一名穿着全套装备的消防员拿着一只又生又粉的火鸡，挂在一根长棍的末端走了出来。

00:43:31.730 --> 00:43:47.370
<v Stephanie Foo>He lowers the turkey into the pot. It's totally submerged in oil. And then the oil bubbles and overflows, spilling everywhere, and a couple of fireballs even burst out of the pot in gusts. And then, just when you think it's over, here comes the best part.
<v Stephanie Foo>他把火鸡放入锅里。它完全沉没在油里。然后油冒泡并溢出，到处乱洒，甚至有几个火球从锅里爆发出来。然后，当你以为结束时，最好的部分来了。

00:43:47.370 --> 00:43:48.840
<v Stephanie Foo>[OIL SIZZLING]
<v Stephanie Foo>[油滋滋声]

00:43:48.840 --> 00:44:03.020
<v Stephanie Foo>Suddenly, an enormous, 20-foot column of fire blasts out of the pot, like Sauron himself has been conjured by way of poultry sacrifice. I watched it again and again. Then, I pulled in my coworker--
<v Stephanie Foo>突然，一根巨大的、20英尺高的火柱从锅里喷射而出，就像萨鲁曼（Sauron）本人通过家禽献祭被召唤出来一样。我一遍又一遍地看。然后，我拉来了我的同事——

00:44:03.020 --> 00:44:03.710
<v Stephanie Foo>Sean, come here.
<v Stephanie Foo>肖恩（Sean），过来。

00:44:03.710 --> 00:44:04.090
<v Sean Cole>What?
<v Sean Cole>什么？

00:44:04.090 --> 00:44:04.860
<v Stephanie Foo>Come here.
<v Stephanie Foo>过来。

00:44:04.860 --> 00:44:06.680
<v Ira Glass>--Sean Cole, to watch with me another time.
<v Ira Glass>——肖恩·科尔（Sean Cole），和我一起再看一次。

00:44:06.680 --> 00:44:07.660
<v Sean Cole>Oh, my god.
<v Sean Cole>噢，天哪。

00:44:07.660 --> 00:44:08.150
<v Stephanie Foo>Whoa!
<v Stephanie Foo>哇！

00:44:08.150 --> 00:44:09.140
<v Sean Cole>Oh, wow!
<v Sean Cole>噢，哇！

00:44:09.140 --> 00:44:12.570
<v Stephanie Foo>[LAUGHS EXCITEDLY] Oh, my god.
<v Stephanie Foo>[兴奋的笑声] 噢，天哪。

00:44:12.570 --> 00:44:15.660
<v Sean Cole>That was great.
<v Sean Cole>那太棒了。

