<v Stephanie Foo>[EPIC MUSIC PLAYING]
<v Stephanie Foo>[史诗音乐播放]

00:44:57.190 --> 00:45:11.440
<v Stephanie Foo>Some spray water in the pot, obviously something you should never do with a grease fire, as it doubles the size of the flames. William Shatner even stars in one video titled "Eat, Fry, Love," created by State Farm. In it, he's playing the inept chef.
<v Stephanie Foo>一些向锅里喷水，显然是你面对油脂火灾时永远不该做的事，因为它会让火焰翻倍。威廉·夏特纳（William Shatner）甚至主演了一个名为“吃、炸、爱”的视频，由State Farm创建。他在里面扮演那个笨手笨脚的厨师。

00:45:11.440 --> 00:45:18.980
<v William Shatner>I want a moister, tastier turkey. I want a deep-fried turkey.
<v William Shatner>我想要一只更湿润、更美味的火鸡。我想要深炸火鸡。

00:45:18.980 --> 00:45:20.980
<v Stephanie Foo>And there's a dubstep remix.
<v Stephanie Foo>还有Dubstep重混版。

